["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">活用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かつよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实际应用；灵活运用；充分利用；善加利用；（语法）活用；词形变化；屈折变化</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113013\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>機会<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>最大限<rp>(</rp><rt>さいだいげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>活用<rp>(</rp><rt>かつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他尽了最大可能</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">活力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かつりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">活力；精力；生命力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219291\">この<ruby>薬<rp>(</rp><rt>くすり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>活力<rp>(</rp><rt>かつりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>補給<rp>(</rp><rt>ほきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してくれます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这药能让你恢复体力</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">假定；假设；假想；（语法）假定；假设条件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95691\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がここにいると<ruby>仮定<rp>(</rp><rt>かてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してみよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让我们假设她在这里。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5549687\" title=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家庭</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">家庭</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">家</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">課程</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">课程；课程体系</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208250\">その<ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>課程<rp>(</rp><rt>かてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>自然科学<rp>(</rp><rt>しぜんかがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>社会科学<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃかいかがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>成<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">该大学的课程包括自然科学和社会科学。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">過程</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">过程；进程；机制</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211919\">その<ruby>過程<rp>(</rp><rt>かてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ru