lass=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">假名；日语音节文字（平假名和片假名）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家内</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（我的）妻子；太太；家里；家庭；家人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186896\"><ruby>家内<rp>(</rp><rt>かない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>夕食<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>支度<rp>(</rp><rt>したく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我妻子正在准备晚餐</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">叶う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かなう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实现；成真；（愿望）得到满足；（祈祷）应验；（爱情）得到回应</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233024\">あなたの<ruby>望<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みがみんな<ruby>叶<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いますように。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">愿你所有的愿望都实现!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">叶える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かなえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">满足；实现；成全；应允</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80951\"><ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>叶<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるためにはある<ruby>程度<rp>(</rp><rt>ていど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>犠牲<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>・<ruby>努力<rp>(</rp><rt>どりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>・<ruby>苦労<rp>(</rp><rt>くろう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>覚悟<rp>(</rp><rt>かくご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为了实现梦想，我已经有了一定程度的犠牲、努力、劳苦这样的觉悟。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1082860\" title=\"Tatoeba · hkfreddy\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · hkfreddy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悲しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かなしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">悲伤的；悲惨的；不快乐的；哀伤的；令人悲哀的；令人遗憾的；可叹的；令人痛心的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"1502040\">そんな<ruby>悲<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ないで。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">别给我这么悲哀的表情</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悲しむ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かなしむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感到悲伤；哀悼；后悔</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85943\"><ruby>悲<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しんでいる<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をそっとしておきなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要蒙蔽她的悲伤。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮名遣い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かなづかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">假名用法；假名拼写规则</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金槌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かなづち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">锤子；铁锤；旱鸭子；不会游泳的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216505\">ジェーンはかなづち<ruby>同然<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>泳<rp>(</rp><rt>およ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">简游得像块砖头</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">必ず</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かならず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">一定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">必</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">必ずしも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かならずしも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不一定；未必；不必然；并非都</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoe